WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.680
Transfer opens the transfer panel in place of the keypad.

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:09.110
Blind sends the call straight to them.

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:12.700
Warm lets you speak to them before the call is handed over.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:19.840
Pick the destination from the Directory, or type an extension, a name or a phone number.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:25.550
For a Contact Center call, the panel lists Agents, Queues and Outside numbers.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:30.764
In a warm transfer, click Complete transfer to hand the caller over, or

00:00:30.764 --> 00:00:33.488
Cancel transfer to go back to the caller.

00:00:33.488 --> 00:00:38.590
If the person does not answer within thirty seconds, the caller comes back to you.

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:42.172
The buttons depend on your phone system.

00:00:42.172 --> 00:00:44.574
Asterisk supports blind transfer.

00:00:44.574 --> 00:00:47.160
Telnyx supports the consult as well.

